---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import LeadPopup from "../components/LeadPopup.astro";
import BackToTop from "../components/BackToTop.astro";

const description =
  "EliteFitness Is the oldest bodybuilding community forums in the world, started in 1996 it has grow to over 400,000 members. With topics like Anabolic steroids,Sarms,prohormones,TRT, hormone replacement and bodybuilding.";
const bodyClass = "home blog header-image full-width-content magazine-home";
---
<BaseLayout title="EliteFitness.com Bodybuilding and Steroids Mega community" description={description} bodyClass={bodyClass}>
  <Header />
  <div class="site-container">
    <div class="background-couple"></div>
    <div class="site-inner bgPattern">
      <div class="content-sidebar-wrap">
        <main class="content">



<div class="breadcrumbnew_and_tiitle">
  <h1 class="entry-title">Disclaimer </h1>

  <div class="breadcrumbnew">
    <p><strong>October 27, 2026p</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mainadvertise wrapWhite mt40">
  <div class="advertiseContent">
    
	

  <p>
    This “Website” or the “Site” is only meant for informational purposes. The site (EliteFitness.com) does not promote
    the use, purchase, sale, and distribution of anabolic steroids. This site is not meant for people below ages of 21
    years and we do not recommend use of steroids or other performance enhancing drugs for purposes other than
    medicinal.
  </p>
  <h3>Legal Age Required (21 or older):</h3>
  <p>
    You must be of legal age to access this Site (Website and Forums and Blog). EliteFitness.com, “The Company” does not
    sell or serve information to persons under the age of 21. By accessing the Site, you swear and affirm that you are
    over the age of 21.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Company makes every effort to ensure that information is not delivered to nor served to anyone who is under the
    age of 21. By accessing this Site, you agree that any information from or received by you from representatives of
    the Company is intended for entertainment and informational use only. If you do not agree with these conditions of
    use, please do not use this Site. If you intentionally or unintentionally misrepresent your age in order to access
    the site, you will be banned and IP banned.
  </p>
  <h3>Freedom of Speech:</h3>
  <p>
    One of the foundations of our community is free speech. We believe that open and free discussion is essential for
    exchanging ideas and expanding knowledge. This is what allows us to grow and improve as a community. As such, we
    will do everything in our power to protect free speech. This includes maintaining a platform where all voices can be
    heard and ensuring that dissenting opinions are respected. We believe that this openness is what makes our community
    great, and we will continue to fight for it.
  </p>
  <p>
    We strongly support the first amendment of the constitution and believe in the open and free discussion of all
    topics, such as Anabolic Steroids and many other bodybuilding products.
  </p>
  <h3>LGBTQ rights:</h3>
  <p>
    Our community and forums believe in LGBTQ rights. We are committed to creating a safe and inclusive environment for
    all members of the LGBTQ community. We believe that everyone should be treated with respect and dignity, regardless
    of their sexual orientation or gender identity. We stand united against discrimination, bigotry, and hatred. We
    believe that love is love, and we will fight for the rights of all LGBTQ people. We are a community that believes in
    equality for all. LGBTQ rights are human rights, and we will continue to fight for them until everyone is treated
    with equal respect and dignity. Thank you for being a part of our community and helping us to create a more
    inclusive world.
  </p>
  <p><strong>Government Warning Concerning Health Consequences of Anabolic Steroids:</strong></p>
  <p>
    By accessing this Site, you acknowledge that there is a government warning concerning the health effects of using
    anabolic steroids.
  </p>
  <h3>Laws and penalties for anabolic steroid abuse</h3>
  <p>
    The Anabolic Steroids Control Act of 1990 placed anabolic steroids into Schedule III of the Controlled Substances
    Act (CSA) as of February 27, 1991. Under this legislation, anabolic steroids are defined as any drug or hormonal
    substance chemically and pharmacologically related to testosterone (other than estrogens, progestins, and
    corticosteroids) that promotes muscle growth.
  </p>
  <p>The possession or sale of anabolic steroids without a valid prescription is illegal.</p>


	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
  </div>
</div>











